    "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/d6de1f58b5e414b5695b8e6fd2b57927.avif?t=1754503310\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/1550e64b23e29b3367193cbc05828e9c.avif?t=1754503310\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A captain outfit: the Libertine set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Born With It and Stay Alive emotes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Pissed and Sea of Tears fireworks  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent internet connection and Ubisoft Account required.</p></p><br><h1>Premium Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/45d1b44a50438f14838c8c0b7566f80d.avif?t=1754503310\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All Deluxe Edition content, including a captain outfit, two emotes, and two fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Grand Game Collection, including a captain outfit, a ship set, a figurehead, and a firework</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Jack's Noggin pet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Silver Haze ship aura</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digital art book and selected songs from the game soundtrack*  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Access the digital art book and soundtrack from the official Skull and Bones website </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent internet connection and Ubisoft account required.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SKULL AND BONES FOR FREE</h2>Ready your cannons and try the full game for 6 hours for free! All your progress will be saved and carried over upon purchase of the full game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN SPECTACULAR NAVAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Prepare for devastating battles by crafting different ships and equip your fleet with powerful loadouts. Unlock stronger weapons as you progress and customize your ships to reflect your unique pirate playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAIL INTO A DANGEROUS HELL IN PARADISE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Voyage into the Indian Ocean and explore a vast open world teeming with cutthroat pirates, deadly sea monsters, supernatural threats, devastating storms, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP WITH OR BATTLE AGAINST FELLOW PIRATES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/9bec46a4219dcca1c92a191e286ead8a.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/9bec46a4219dcca1c92a191e286ead8a.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Join up to two friends or other players to partake in shareable contracts and rewards. Or, dominate the competition and destroy other bloodthirsty players in a thrilling team-based PvP mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY EVER-EVOLVING CONTENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/6f3d4e16eb081547542a1b0248484058.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/6f3d4e16eb081547542a1b0248484058.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Each season enhances the pirate experience with exciting new features, formidable new threats, fresh ways to play the endgame, and quality-of-life improvements designed to keep players engaged.<br><br>Persistent internet connection and Ubisoft account required.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SKULL AND BONES FOR FREE</h2>Ready your cannons and try the full game for 6 hours for free! All your progress will be saved and carried over upon purchase of the full game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGE IN SPECTACULAR NAVAL COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86586fbce062232b51f12a402270c41f.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Prepare for devastating battles by crafting different ships and equip your fleet with powerful loadouts. Unlock stronger weapons as you progress and customize your ships to reflect your unique pirate playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAIL INTO A DANGEROUS HELL IN PARADISE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/86cb725437d37b9fd0289a4c23c918a7.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Voyage into the Indian Ocean and explore a vast open world teeming with cutthroat pirates, deadly sea monsters, supernatural threats, devastating storms, and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP WITH OR BATTLE AGAINST FELLOW PIRATES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/9bec46a4219dcca1c92a191e286ead8a.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/9bec46a4219dcca1c92a191e286ead8a.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Join up to two friends or other players to partake in shareable contracts and rewards. Or, dominate the competition and destroy other bloodthirsty players in a thrilling team-based PvP mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY EVER-EVOLVING CONTENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/6f3d4e16eb081547542a1b0248484058.poster.avif?t=1754503310\" width=600 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/6f3d4e16eb081547542a1b0248484058.webm?t=1754503310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Each season enhances the pirate experience with exciting new features, formidable new threats, fresh ways to play the endgame, and quality-of-life improvements designed to keep players engaged.<br><br>Persistent internet connection and Ubisoft account required.",
    "short_description": "Set sail into the vibrant open world of Skull and Bones, a naval online action RPG where you rise to become the most fearsome pirate kingpin. Customize your fleet, craft unique ships, and forge formidable weapons to dominate in exhilarating sea battles.",
